    "description": "A Repeater in a heavy greatcoat, gloves, hobnailed boots and an old smoke-mask that hides his face completely. All are identical. They cannot be spoken to, though they may shout a muffled order a heartbeat before firing.\nAlso: a chorus of not-quite-dead victims trails each killer: soldiers burned on the eastern front, concert-goers blown out of their shoes, Society members strangled, stabbed and drowned. They never touch or hinder anyone and cannot be harmed; seeing them is Disquiet or worse, by how ruined they are. A character cannot hide from STATIC for long: the killers go straight to where they are hidden and search as if they know. Each round the character tests Agility DR12 to stay hidden; the first Failure finds them.",
